      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5a6600a092b3ff44cffeb382|full_name}: Yeah video players in VRChat have always been really finnicky and broken, but it seems like they're now actively getting WORSE instead of better with almost every new patch. \n\nA few of the issues over the months have been caused by external stuff like youtube-dl in fairness, but the vast majority of the issues with this player aren't because of youtube-dl going out of date and needing updating, that's just something that happens sometimes. Stuff like this on the other hand or causing crashing (which I've been experiencing with people for well over half a year now when I use the SyncStream player on any of my maps), I don't understand why the videoplayers keep breaking further and further.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
