  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Have recently been having issues with people joining my video player maps (that I have not updated recently and were working fine before) and I'd say about half the people who join will only see a black screen. Thankfully, this is fixable by leaving the instance, clearing your cache, and then rejoining. Doing that fixed it every time for people, but it's still annoying having to keep doing that, especially in a 40 person instance where almost every new joiner has to do this.\n\nUsing VRC_SyncVideoPlayer, not VRC_SyncVideoStream",
